  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3002.11 Emissions reduction credit certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3002.11 \"Emissions reduction credit certificate\" means \"emissions reduction credit certificate\" as defined in RSA 125-J:1,XIII, namely \"the document issued by the department certifying emissions reductions for use consistent with this chapter.\"\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
